      "text": "Your Facility is already using its full node limit: all of its Repos share one limit for normal\njobs.\n\u2022 Your job starts as the Facility's running jobs finish.\n\u2022 Use --qos preemptable to run outside the limit.\n\u2022 If this happens often, ask your Facility Czar to increase the Allocation or to change how it is\n   split between Repos.",
      "originalText": "Your Facility is already using its full node limit: all of its Repos share one limit for normal\njobs.\n\u2022 Your job starts as the Facility's running jobs finish.\n\u2022 Use --qos preemptable to run outside the limit.\n\u2022 If this happens often, ask your Facility Czar to increase the Allocation or to change how it is\n   split between Repos.",
