      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1432941100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The nodes your job needs are down or reserved, often for planned maintenance. A job whose --time\nwould run into a maintenance window waits until the window is over.\n\u2022 Lower --time so the job can finish before the window, or wait.\n\u2022 It also happens when no node still has a feature your --constraint asks for, including\n   constraints Slurm adds by default. Such a job will never start: cancel it and resubmit with a\n   feature listed by sinfo -o \"%P %b\".\n\u2022 Check that --gpus does not ask for more GPUs than the partition's nodes have.",
      "originalText": "The nodes your job needs are down or reserved, often for planned maintenance. A job whose --time\nwould run into a maintenance window waits until the window is over.\n\u2022 Lower --time so the job can finish before the window, or wait.\n\u2022 It also happens when no node still has a feature your --constraint asks for, including\n   constraints Slurm adds by default. Such a job will never start: cancel it and resubmit with a\n   feature listed by sinfo -o \"%P %b\".\n\u2022 Check that --gpus does not ask for more GPUs than the partition's nodes have.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p37",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
