      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dependency: the job waits for the job named in --dependency and starts on its own.\nDependencyNeverSatisfied: that job failed, so this one will never start. Cancel it with scancel\n<jobid>, fix the first job and resubmit both.",
      "originalText": "Dependency: the job waits for the job named in --dependency and starts on its own.\nDependencyNeverSatisfied: that job failed, so this one will never start. Cancel it with scancel\n<jobid>, fix the first job and resubmit both.",
